# - Summary of changes

* Sat Jun 06 2026 Miika Malin <miikasda@users.noreply.github.com> - 0.2.1-1
- Fix multiple issues occurring on Sailfish OS 5.1
- Add autorotation support, configurable from Additional Options
- Warning: Autorotation uses a system-wide setting that affects all apps
- Without autorotation, system gestures have incorrect rotation on Sailfish OS 5.1

